  "fullDescription": "INCLUDES: 1 .swatches file with 30 color swatches for the Procreate app\n\nINSTANT DIGITAL DOWNLOAD\n*Requires Procreate app + iPad / iPad Pro / iPhone\n\nA Procreate color / colour palette 1 .swatches file with 30 swatches with soft pastel & bright light dark gradient yellow, blonde, honey orange, ginger, red, wood brown, beige, brunette, cinnamon & terracotta brown ombre tones & for digital art illustration, a painting color scheme, iPad Pro hand lettering digital brushes illustrating & Apple Pencil lettering, drawing, painting on the Procreate app. Illustrating designs digitally for occasions & celebrations like Christmas, Xmas, New Year, Halloween, Easter, Thanksgiving, Valentines Day, natural & custom hair color tones for portrait art, birthday party cards, weddings, bridal showers, baby showers, Goodnotes, Notability, Noteshelf, Xodo digital planning, scrapbooking, digital planner aesthetic decor, posters, festive holidays, printable art prints and more.\n\nHappy drawing! 🙂\n\nINSTANT DIGITAL DOWNLOAD\n*REQUIRES IPAD + PROCREATE APP (on iPad)\n\nWHAT’S INCLUDED:\n– 1 .swatches digital file\n\n(Only compatible with the PROCREATE APP on the iPad)\n\nIMPORTING THE PALETTE TO PROCREATE:\n\n-Go to downloads on your ipad or the location you downloaded the .swatches file to.\n\n-Press on the .swatches file, then it should import to procreate (the iPad should automatically take you to procreate, say ‘importing’ with a blue tick under it).\n\n-Then go to ‘Palettes’ on Procreate and scroll down palletes until you get to the bottom where your new pallete should be.\n\n(To get to ‘Palettes’ – press the circle on the top right hand corner, then at the bottom of the drop down there are five buttons and the last one, after ‘value’ is ‘palettes’.)\n\nHope this helps 🙂\n\nThank you so much for stopping by the shop and have a great day 🙂\n\nZara Roza Designs",
